Cleaned prose extracted from IETF RFC plaintext (RFCs 793, 854, 959, 1035, 2616,
4251, 5321), used as build-time input for the tech register of the prose predictor
seed. RFC text is freely reproducible; only derived token frequencies ship in the
app (prose_en_v1.sketch), not the RFC text itself.
